# BastionOS — Security Lab profile EXTRAS (installed on top of minimal + desktop).
# The VAPT toolkit itself is CONTAINERIZED and scope-enforced in Phase 6 (bastion-scan),
# NOT installed as host packages — that keeps tools fresh and off the host. Only a few
# host-side helpers and the container runtime live here.

# Container tooling for the VAPT images
podman
uidmap
slirp4netns
fuse-overlayfs
buildah
skopeo

# A couple of host CLIs that are awkward to containerize
nmap
whois
dnsutils

# NOTE: nuclei/httpx/ffuf/sqlmap/zap/metasploit/trivy/etc. are delivered as pinned
# container images via `bastion-scan` in Phase 6, with engagement-scope enforcement.
